{
  "slug": "tokensafe",
  "name": "Tokensafe",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Solana token safety scanner behind x402 micropayments. Checks mint/freeze authority, holder concentration, liquidity, LP locks, honeypot detection, metadata mutability, token age, and Token-2022 extensions. Risk score 0-100 where every point traces to on-chain state. $0.008 request in USDC, no API keys, no accounts. Free lite endpoint and MCP tools included.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install tokensafe@claude-community` from `ampactor-labs/tokensafe`.\n\nSolana token safety scanner. Deterministic on-chain analysis, cryptographically signed, behind x402 micropayments.\n\nSolana token safety scanner behind x402 micropayments. Checks mint/freeze authority, holder concentration, liquidity, LP locks, honeypot detection, metadata mutability, token age, and Token-2022 extensions. Risk score 0-100 where every point traces to on-chain state. $0.008 request in USDC, no API keys, no accounts. Free lite endpoint and MCP tools included.",
